{"screen_name": "ishii_13kaidann", "file": "ishii_13kaidann", "name": "石井", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1249983260093906945/5SwnxAMA.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/861002216/1503814416/1500x500", "description": "絵を描く垢です 遊戯王中心\nスケブ http://skeb.jp/@ishii_13kaidann\nBOOTH  http://ishii.booth.pm", "total_works": 44, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-02-18T11:01:49.286197+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-18T11:01:49.286197+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-18T11:01:49.286197+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 5000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 5000, "max": 5000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/ishii_13kaidann", "name": "ishii_13kaidann"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://ishii.booth.pm", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/5120193", "name": "5120193"}], "flags": {}, "works": [{"path": "/@ishii_13kaidann/works/45", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b04982bd/uploads/origins/a180ad29-d692-4c24-a820-b1b3baed895d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf97a08c9ab85bfb17eb95f62c5dca51", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b04982bd/uploads/origins/a180ad29-d692-4c24-a820-b1b3baed895d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf97a08c9ab85bfb17eb95f62c5dca51, https://si.imgix.net/b04982bd/uploads/origins/a180ad29-d692-4c24-a820-b1b3baed895d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14ce90dfa533a5d4d861baa71c2ad700 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b04982bd/uploads/origins/a180ad29-d692-4c24-a820-b1b3baed895d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aaa95bb2fbf9f62dbf4a05c973f10b26 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私のオリジナルキャラクターを描いていただけますか？彼女の名前はレッテ・トゥース・エトストップです。マッケとアッコの母親で、二人の娘の特徴を受け継いでいます。髪は紫と茶色の混ざった色で、青の痕跡も残っています。娘のマッケ同様、コスプレ、特にパッチワーク風の衣装が好きです。そしてアッコとウサギ耳の呪いへの連帯を示すため、偽物のウサギ耳をつけています。\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/a502t9a9t6gprqjcahujq/Lett-Tuce-Etstop.png?rlkey=h4ri0s60yede6hz2c84ys9tgt&st=tdzl2wu9&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ishii_13kaidann/works/44", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/22857ea7/uploads/origins/448230cf-d909-494e-83b4-2cefaf2083d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=32f63051c55a1f099d82ccc345567880", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/22857ea7/uploads/origins/448230cf-d909-494e-83b4-2cefaf2083d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=32f63051c55a1f099d82ccc345567880, https://si.imgix.net/22857ea7/uploads/origins/448230cf-d909-494e-83b4-2cefaf2083d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6a5fea31ab0d85d1944b4fce8a580e40 2x, https://si.imgix.net/22857ea7/uploads/origins/448230cf-d909-494e-83b4-2cefaf2083d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8c2edd70a18bab3c478a81065d9d6297 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ishii_13kaidann/works/43", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2d75c2e6/uploads/origins/1f602b4f-0f69-4b23-acb9-01210736c301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=773db20ccde01d5635d8409c10f97a7e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2d75c2e6/uploads/origins/1f602b4f-0f69-4b23-acb9-01210736c301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=773db20ccde01d5635d8409c10f97a7e, https://si.imgix.net/2d75c2e6/uploads/origins/1f602b4f-0f69-4b23-acb9-01210736c301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97016bb2b56e89407434e3beb49ae11b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2d75c2e6/uploads/origins/1f602b4f-0f69-4b23-acb9-01210736c301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a27128ab3eb1ede7d20edc52245a9d22 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "クッキーを焼くギラティナ枢機卿を描いてくれる？\n\nカーディナル・マトロン・ギラティナは、ポケモン「ギラティナ」のギジンカアバターです。そのため、ギラティナを使うことで有名な2人のトレーナー、シンシア（シロナ）とボロ（ウォロ）の特徴を引き継いでいます。\n\nギラティナ: https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/fqq2yjc1we3f0mz7migtm/Cardinal-Matron-Giratina.png?rlkey=z86b80ltlbz5ihw9asbxg6nih&st=q9wte0vp&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ishii_13kaidann/works/42", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d5545256/uploads/origins/41aa0516-916e-4c0b-b96a-8b29f7cb2eee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4740b4cbd2ef8366c7960dd07736a53", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d5545256/uploads/origins/41aa0516-916e-4c0b-b96a-8b29f7cb2eee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4740b4cbd2ef8366c7960dd07736a53, https://si.imgix.net/d5545256/uploads/origins/41aa0516-916e-4c0b-b96a-8b29f7cb2eee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e56d5a80b2fa5fd023e200e278f8a6e3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d5545256/uploads/origins/41aa0516-916e-4c0b-b96a-8b29f7cb2eee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2acbae0c50082e70e3eeb08962f20fd7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ファントムウィッチモンを描いてくれる？\n\nファントムウィッチモンは、霧雨魔理沙がウィッチモンとワルダモンと融合して悪魔の魔女に変身した姿です。\n\nファントムウィッチモン：https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/vypqologbc1d9rdg53wd5/Photo-Aug-11-2025-5-51-37-PM.png?rlkey=xj7xodrv5miyuuskks7u6loln&st=9ecp2uvv&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ishii_13kaidann/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/03c3d6e4/uploads/origins/973f6f56-7efa-4e8a-8854-2602